ngers of each realm and stay one step ahead of the horrors pursuing them as they search for a way out.", "summary": "Embark on a new adventure in the unique world of Little Nightmares.\n\nIn Little Nightmares III, you follow the journey of Low & Alone, as they search for a path that could lead them out of the Nowhere.\n\nTrapped within the Spiral, a cluster of disturbing places, the two friends will have to work together to survive in a dangerous world full of delusions and escape the grasp of an even greater threat lurking in the shadows.\n\nFor the first time in the franchise, face your childhood fears together with a friend using online co-op, or solo with an AI companion.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 23, "name": "Stealth"}, {"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/little-nightmares-iii--1", "videos": [{"id": 96124, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "XFHOsobwFrA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XFHOsobwFrA", "title": "Little Nightmares III \u2013 Announcement Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/XFHOsobwFrA/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 96198, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "UjrtoFazU1U", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UjrtoFazU1U", "title": "Little Nightmares 3 - Reveal Trailer | gamescom 2023", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/UjrtoFazU1U/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 96308, "name": "Dev Diary", "video_id": "LSuXjRKVVbI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LSuXjRKVVbI", "title": "Little Nightmares 3 Interview with Lucas Roussel and Coralie Feniello | gamescom 2023 #ONL", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/LSuXjRKVVbI/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 123477, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "miK1hqlEsTE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=miK1hqlEsTE", "title": "Little Nightmares III \u2013 Friendship Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/miK1hqlEsTE/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 154529, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "narIoF9doAM", "url": "https://www.